{
  "schema_version": "vc-audit-corpus-v1",
  "description": "VC Audit v1 固定刺激語料。Phase 1 = text-fallback 路徑（繞過 VAD/ASR），Phase 1.5 = 另需 audio corpus（見 ticket §4）。",
  "profile": "clients/voice_companion/profiles/rem.json",
